<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="yIK44HL6ksb-2NbcMzJG">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3625" dy="2943" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" background="light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFCCE6)" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Client as Client / Mobile App\n    participant API as .NET 10 Web API (AOT)\n    participant Redis as Redis (Memory Cache &amp; Lock)\n    participant DB as SQL Server (Transactional Store)\n    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ (Message Broker)\n    participant PayWorker as .NET 10 Payment Worker\n    participant PaySvc as External Payment Service\n    participant ShipWorker as .NET 10 Shipping Worker\n    participant ShipSvc as Logistics / Shipping Service\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/orders (Payload + Idempotency-Key header)\n    API-&gt;&gt;Redis: SET idem:{key} \&quot;PROCESSING\&quot; NX EX 120 (fast-path lock)\n    alt Request ซ้ำ (Duplicate Request)\n    Redis--&gt;&gt;API: Key exists (PROCESSING / COMPLETED:{orderId})\n    API--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (same OrderId) / 409 Conflict (still processing)\n    else Request ใหม่ (First Request)\n    Redis--&gt;&gt;API: OK (Lock acquired)\n    end\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;Redis: EVALSHA Lua (Stock &gt;= Qty &amp; DECRBY) - fast pre-check\n    alt สต็อกไม่พอ (Out of Stock)\n    Redis--&gt;&gt;API: Stock Insufficient\n    API-&gt;&gt;Redis: DEL idem:{key}\n    API--&gt;&gt;Client: 409 Conflict (ProblemDetails: Insufficient stock)\n    else จองสต็อกสำเร็จ (Stock Reserved)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN TRAN · UPDATE Products SET Stock = Stock - qty&lt;br/&gt;WHERE Id = @id AND IsActive = 1 AND Stock &gt;= qty&lt;br/&gt;(0 rows → ROLLBACK, INCRBY Redis, 409)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT Order (PendingPayment, UNIQUE IdempotencyKey) + OrderItems&lt;br/&gt;+ OutboxMessages (OrderCreatedEvent) · COMMIT\n    API-&gt;&gt;Redis: SET idem:{key} \&quot;COMPLETED:{orderId}\&quot; EX 86400\n    API--&gt;&gt;Client: 201 Created (OrderId, Status: PendingPayment)\n    end\n\n    DB-&gt;&gt;RMQ: Outbox Relay: Publish OrderCreatedEvent&lt;br/&gt;(MessageId = Outbox.Id) → set ProcessedAtUtc\n    RMQ-&gt;&gt;PayWorker: Consume OrderCreatedEvent\n    PayWorker-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT ProcessedMessages (UNIQUE MessageId)&lt;br/&gt;duplicate → ack &amp; skip\n    PayWorker-&gt;&gt;PaySvc: Charge (Idempotency-Key = OrderId)\n    alt ชำระเงินล้มเหลว / Timeout (Compensating Transaction)\n    PaySvc--&gt;&gt;PayWorker: Payment Failed / Expired\n    PayWorker-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE Orders SET Status = 'Cancelled' WHERE Status = 'PendingPayment'&lt;br/&gt;+ UPDATE Products SET Stock = Stock + qty (same TRAN)\n    PayWorker-&gt;&gt;Redis: INCRBY stock:{productId} qty (sync cache)\n    else ชำระเงินสำเร็จ (Payment Succeeded)\n    PaySvc--&gt;&gt;PayWorker: Payment Succeeded\n    PayWorker-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE Orders SET Status = 'Paid' WHERE Status = 'PendingPayment'&lt;br/&gt;+ OutboxMessages (OrderPaidEvent) · COMMIT, then ack\n    DB-&gt;&gt;RMQ: Outbox Relay: Publish OrderPaidEvent\n    end\n\n    RMQ-&gt;&gt;ShipWorker: Consume OrderPaidEvent\n    ShipWorker-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT ProcessedMessages (UNIQUE MessageId)&lt;br/&gt;duplicate → ack &amp; skip\n    ShipWorker-&gt;&gt;ShipSvc: Create Shipment &amp; Label (Idempotency-Key = OrderId)\n    ShipSvc--&gt;&gt;ShipWorker: Tracking Number Generated\n    ShipWorker-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE Orders SET Status = 'ReadyToShip', TrackingNo&lt;br/&gt;WHERE Status = 'Paid'&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#10;}" id="Guwt-7PnpvpXGyG5PptR-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1">
